[00:53.259]The stars are distant as always
[00:59.800]
[01:00.288]Still shining with the light of their grand deaths in vacant space
[01:09.050]
[01:09.689]Let it penetrate the darkness when a beast roars a final wail
[01:17.798]
[01:18.298]Let it penetrate my heart so I can share your pain
[01:27.298]
[01:29.298]If there is a way to collect and portray
[01:37.550]
[01:37.800]A mood that cannot be projected into words
[01:46.048]
[01:46.426]If there is a way to turn back and rebuild all the long lost dreams
[01:54.799]
[01:55.093]Another branch will grow and flourish in the future
[02:03.299]
[02:03.549]The breeze of your world will wake you up again
